* **TileJSON & vector-tile hosting** – Many providers (MapTiler Cloud, OpenMapTiles, Planet) expose a `url` field you can drop straight into the style.  
* **Performance tips for vector tiles** – See the “GeoJSON and Direct Data Sources” section of the *maplibre-tile-sources* skill for thresholds and why vector tiles are the go-to for > 5 k features.  

